OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after motorcyclist
OL,4,Adies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after another
OL,7,Fman died in a crash between a
OL,8,Fmotorcycle and a car.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said they received
OL,11,Fa call at 17:36 GMT on Wednesday
OL,12,Ffollowing a crash involving a Silver
OL,13,FKia Serento and a Black Yamaha
OL,14,Fmotorcycle on Main Street, Dorrington,
OL,15,Fat the junction with the B1188.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist, an 18-year-old man,
OL,18,Fdied at the scene. The 51-year-old
OL,19,Fdriver of the Serento was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,21,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
